              "time": 0.0,
              "coords": {
                "factor_rows": 5
              },
              "expected": 7.1214999999999975
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "the_minimum_vapor_loss_is_a_sentinel_and_a_floor",
          "description": "A minimumRefuelingVaporLoss <= -1 means `this fuel displaces no vapour`, so the rate goes to 0 and NOT to -1: row 2's raw rate is exp(0) = 1 and its floored rate is 0. Row 4's floor of 1.8 binds on the same raw 1 and returns 1.8. Row 1's 3.0152931 is above its floor and passes through, and it is the number the fixture's gasoline rows carry.",
