        {
          "id": "the_two_stage_ii_program_adjustments_are_live_here_and_nowhere_else",
          "description": "Washtenaw County's countyyear row carries refuelingVaporProgramAdjust = refuelingSpillProgramAdjust = 0, so in the process-refueling fixture BOTH (1 - P) factors are exactly 1 and a document that omitted them would agree with the snapshot on all 336 rows (docs/esm-conventions.md 23). This test is where they are checked: at P = 0.2 and T = 0.5 the blend is 3.0 x 0.8 x 0.5 + 0.5 x 0.8 x 0.5 = 1.4, and at P = 0.3 and T = 0.5 the spillage rate is 0.7 x 0.5 x 0.31 = 0.1085. Row 2 is the snapshot's own inert case beside them, where the blend returns the uncontrolled rate unchanged.",
          "time_span": {
